WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.632 --> 00:00:18.164
Rain poured down on the slope of the Roxy, the Tang Monk, and Wujing expected the Demon of

2
00:00:18.264 --> 00:00:19.605
Black Rain to attack again.

3
00:00:20.926 --> 00:00:22.908
The mountain's spirit appeared in front of the rain.

4
00:00:27.531 --> 00:00:27.912
she said.

5
00:00:29.024 --> 00:00:32.507
"I can control much of what happens on my mountain.

6
00:00:33.448 --> 00:00:38.092
But the demon is powerful, so I can't hold him back for long!"

7
00:00:38.112 --> 00:00:40.935
"Thank you!"

8
00:00:41.335 --> 00:00:42.076
Roxy shouted.

9
00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:51.584
When she and the others were far from Birdsong Mountain, they stopped to rest.

10
00:00:54.806 --> 00:00:56.328
The Tang Monk thanked Roxy.

11
00:00:57.836 --> 00:00:59.057
"You're not from around here.

12
00:00:59.998 --> 00:01:01.519
Did you come from across the ocean?"

13
00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:05.903
"No, I'm from another world," Roxy said.

14
00:01:05.923 --> 00:01:09.185
"Amazing!" the Tang Monk said.

15
00:01:09.205 --> 00:01:13.269
"My companions and I are traveling to the Western Paradise.

16
00:01:14.189 --> 00:01:16.571
I hope to receive the True Scriptures from Buddha."

17
00:01:18.173 --> 00:01:20.975
"The mountain's spirit told me that," Roxy said.

18
00:01:20.995 --> 00:01:24.958
"I wish I could help you, but I must figure out how to get home."

19
00:01:24.978 --> 00:01:28.284
"I understand," the monk said.

20
00:01:36.749 --> 00:01:39.651
have two other companions, but I'm not sure where they are."

21
00:01:39.671 --> 00:01:45.094
"Oh!" Roxy suddenly remembered something.

22
00:01:45.994 --> 00:01:49.296
"The mountain's spirit told me you're traveling with Sun Wukong.

23
00:01:50.297 --> 00:01:51.697
He's in my world right now.

24
00:01:52.698 --> 00:01:56.140
I was fighting with him, but then he tricked me into falling through a portal.

25
00:01:57.792 --> 00:01:58.993
That's how I got here."

26
00:01:59.974 --> 00:02:00.695
She shook her head.

27
00:02:00.715 --> 00:02:03.157
"He was causing lots of trouble."

28
00:02:05.098 --> 00:02:10.463
"I'm not surprised," the monk said with a sigh.

29
00:02:10.483 --> 00:02:13.505
"Wukong is still learning how to be good."

30
00:02:15.006 --> 00:02:18.689
"I'm not surprised either," Wujing said as he looked around.

31
00:02:18.709 --> 00:02:22.192
"We still don't know where Bajie is."

32
00:02:23.353 --> 00:02:24.174
Roxy gasped.

33
00:02:24.875 --> 00:02:26.276
"I met him too!"

34
00:02:28.084 --> 00:02:30.245
"Is he also in your world?"

35
00:02:30.625 --> 00:02:32.306
Wujing asked, lifting an eyebrow.

36
00:02:32.326 --> 00:02:36.347
"Yep, he's in jail," Roxy said.

37
00:02:38.488 --> 00:02:40.429
The Tang Monk put his head in his hands.

38
00:02:40.449 --> 00:02:43.310
"Why won't they learn to be good?"

39
00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:48.232
"It's really important that I get home," Roxy said.

40
00:02:48.252 --> 00:02:52.814
"I don't know what kind of trouble Wukong is causing now that I'm not there."

41
00:02:54.555 --> 00:02:55.115
She sighed.

42
00:02:55.135 --> 00:02:58.601
"When I get back, I don't know what I'll do.

43
00:02:59.321 --> 00:03:02.342
He's as powerful as I am—I can't defeat him."

44
00:03:03.863 --> 00:03:07.285
"Don't worry, I can stop him," the monk said.

45
00:03:11.226 --> 00:03:14.908
we don't know how to open the portal, Master," Wujing said.

46
00:03:14.928 --> 00:03:19.610
"Only Wukong and the Demon of Black Rain know how to do that."

47
00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:23.412
"Don't forget Swift Wing," the Tang Monk said.

48
00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:29.181
"She can help us because she's studying with the bodhisattva Guanyin on Mount Potalaka."

49
00:03:30.602 --> 00:03:32.182
"Master," Wujing said.

50
00:03:32.202 --> 00:03:34.763
"Mount Potalaka is far away.

51
00:03:35.603 --> 00:03:38.904
And the last time I left you alone, the demon captured you.

52
00:03:39.865 --> 00:03:41.245
I can't leave you again."

53
00:03:45.486 --> 00:03:46.707
go," Roxy said.

54
00:03:46.727 --> 00:03:48.827
"I just need directions."

55
00:03:50.328 --> 00:03:51.208
Wujing frowned.

56
00:03:52.152 --> 00:03:56.336
"You're not a spirit, so I don't think you can go there."

57
00:03:58.859 --> 00:03:59.619
Roxy shrugged.

58
00:03:59.639 --> 00:04:01.000
"I'll try it."

59
00:04:01.021 --> 00:04:07.727
"Mount Potalaka is in the middle of the South Sea," Wujing said.

60
00:04:09.709 --> 00:04:11.370
He told Roxy how to find the mountain.

61
00:04:15.174 --> 00:04:17.376
Roxy took off, soaring over the South Sea.

62
00:04:20.532 --> 00:04:22.813
She looked everywhere, but she didn't see any mountains.

63
00:04:24.114 --> 00:04:26.675
However, she eventually saw another continent below.

64
00:04:31.317 --> 00:04:36.679
flew over the entire sea," Roxy said, groaning.

65
00:04:37.619 --> 00:04:43.062
"Where's Mount Bright light filled the sky, and a voice thundered.

66
00:04:43.142 --> 00:04:45.203
"Who are you?"
